    "detail": "external valid: ret 8; external bad_type: ret 189; external short_ps: ret 180; all three leave the error queue empty and write the output buffer. The sign, buffer and queue axes therefore do not distinguish; the returned length does. Only the padding-valid case returns the submitted message."
  },
